1
00:59:44,200 --> 00:59:46,400
and July insisted on coming with me,

2
00:59:46,760 --> 00:59:48,840
and I ordered him to stay.

3
00:59:49,040 --> 00:59:50,400
I don't see the new butler.

4
00:59:50,640 --> 00:59:52,720
I don't know, he must be in his room, I guess.

5
00:59:55,480 --> 00:59:56,920
Apakah kamu tahu apa yang telah terjadi?

6
00:59:57,480 --> 00:59:59,160
No, but I heard screaming.

7
00:59:59,320 --> 01:00:03,200
I tried to wake Warner up. Our rooms are across from each other.

8
01:00:03,800 --> 01:00:05,320
But he wasn't in his room.

9
01:00:05,440 --> 01:00:07,280
His bed was not unmade.

10
01:00:07,880 --> 01:00:10,240
If the screams woke up Mrs. Peterson, Warner should have heard them.

11
01:00:11,000 --> 01:00:12,880
You're right, I did hear them.

12
01:00:13,040 --> 01:00:14,080
Senang mendengarnya.

13
01:00:14,200 --> 01:00:15,240
So where have you been?

14
01:00:15,480 --> 01:00:17,080
I was outside, near the woods.

15
01:00:17,680 --> 01:00:18,960
We killed Ms. Hollander.

16
01:00:20,880 --> 01:00:22,720
Apakah itu mengejutkan Anda?

17
01:00:22,840 --> 01:00:24,280
Apakah Anda terkejut?

18
01:00:25,040 --> 01:00:26,600
I've seen better acting performance.

19
01:00:28,160 --> 01:00:31,280
And now I remember you. Your name is not Warner.

20
01:00:32,040 --> 01:00:34,360
I've got a wanted poster with your your picture at the office.

21
01:00:34,760 --> 01:00:38,200
It wasn't long ago that the Chicago Chicago police were looking for you for theft.

22
01:00:38,680 --> 01:00:40,800
Benar lagi. They found me, they tried me,

23
01:00:41,000 --> 01:00:43,120
I proved my innocence and I was acquitted.

24
01:00:43,800 --> 01:00:45,240
Let's say you got away with it this time.

25
01:00:46,120 --> 01:00:47,480
Where were you when they killed that poor child?

26
01:00:47,960 --> 01:00:49,760
Aku sudah bilang padamu. Keluar.

27
01:00:50,040 --> 01:00:52,000
- Why exactly? - I was following you, as you can see.

28
01:00:52,480 --> 01:00:56,240
I saw you following someone, I thought you might need some help.

29
01:00:57,040 --> 01:00:59,360
I followed the beam of your torch to the edge.

30
01:00:59,800 --> 01:01:00,760
Then it disappeared.

31
01:01:01,280 --> 01:01:03,600
And suddenly, as I scanned the darkness,

32
01:01:03,920 --> 01:01:06,120
I was violently hit on the head.

33
01:01:06,360 --> 01:01:09,120
When I opened my eye, I was in the middle of the bushes and then I understood

34
01:01:09,320 --> 01:01:10,920
that I had been knocked out.

35
01:01:11,520 --> 01:01:13,160
I would have loved to have been knocked out.

36
01:01:13,480 --> 01:01:15,640
That way we would have found you with your face still covered.

37
01:01:16,440 --> 01:01:17,680
You were right here, inside,

38
01:01:17,880 --> 01:01:20,440
you went after her like a wild beast with that poker.

39
01:01:21,240 --> 01:01:23,280
I forbid you to accuse me. I am not a beast!

40
01:01:23,640 --> 01:01:25,720
I did not kill anyone, I won't be able to do it.

41
01:01:26,240 --> 01:01:27,760
Change the scapegoat.

42
01:01:58,280 --> 01:01:59,520
Well, Doctor?

43
01:02:00,480 --> 01:02:02,360
I believe there is an autopsy report waiting for you.

44
01:02:04,200 --> 01:02:06,120
The bat has struck again.

45
01:02:07,640 --> 01:02:09,520
Why did you come back?

46
01:02:11,960 --> 01:02:13,640
I had an accident...

47
01:02:14,280 --> 01:02:16,000
two km from here on the way home.

48
01:02:16,880 --> 01:02:20,240
My right rear wheel broke and I ended up in the ditch.

49
01:02:20,680 --> 01:02:24,240
This is the nearest house then, I came back here to ask for help.

50
01:02:25,720 --> 01:02:27,920
I was sure I'd find you around here, Andy.

51
01:02:31,880 --> 01:02:33,600
It looks like you're bleeding.

52
01:02:36,320 --> 01:02:38,960
Does it look like you've been you got hit in the back of the head?

53
01:02:39,680 --> 01:02:40,960
I already told you that I had an accident.

54
01:02:41,120 --> 01:02:44,480
That's what you said, yes. That's what you said.

55
01:02:46,280 --> 01:02:48,000
I may have been wrong about you.
